From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:25:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Open a typed file path from the open dialog

When the location field of an open-file dialog holds the path of an
existing file, Enter opens that file. Before, the dialog changed to the
file's folder and only selected it. Folders and paths that do not exist
keep the old behaviour, and the save and folder dialogs are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

